step Get Runecloth
  tip You need 24 Runecloth for Engineering 225-300: Thorium Widget. Humanoids of level 45-60 drop it, and what you loot as you level counts. The arrow takes you to the best farm for your level: mobs at or below it first, then the most Runecloth per minute and the nearest; it picks again as you level. The guide window shows the kills and minutes it takes there and a second choice. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x24 nearest gather levels 45-60
  auction 14047 x24

step Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs to 245
  tip Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245. Each takes 1 Mithril Bar and 1 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 50 Solid Blasting Powder first. Use the 12 Solid Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Mithril Bar and one Solid Blasting Powder a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Solid Blasting Powder and Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs, learn them now: an earlier step teaches them.
  learn 12585
  learn 12596
  craft 12585 x50
  craft 12596 until 245

step Engineering recipes at 245
  tip Back to an Engineering trainer: Mithril Gyro-Shot (from 245).
  learn 12621

step Mithril Gyro-Shot to 265
  tip Mithril Gyro-Shot is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265. Each takes 2 Mithril Bar and 2 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 56 Solid Blasting Powder first. Two Mithril Bars and two Solid Blasting Powder a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Solid Blasting Powder, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 12585
  craft 12585 x56
  craft 12621 until 265

step Thorium Widget to 287
  tip Thorium Widget is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287. Each takes 3 Thorium Bar and 1 Runecloth. Three Thorium Bars and a Runecloth a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 19791 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19791 until 287

step Thorium Tube to 300
  tip Thorium Tube is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 Thorium Bar. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 19795 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19795 until 300
  skill Engineering 300
